    "causal_inference": "The new provider writes unavailable and raises SourceUnavailable without setting degraded; the new RSS fallback handler catches it in the partial-listing path. The new harvest saves partial candidates and cmd_harvest returns 0 because no exception escapes and degraded is false. This violates the new failed-refresh exit contract.",
