        "observed_or_predicted_behavior": "Demonstrated: the current command logged the RSS failure and unreachable subreddit, retained 0 candidates, and returned exit code 0. Predicted consequence: systemd sees success and does not retry, leaving the blocked subreddit(s) absent from the harvested pool.",
        "title": "Partial RSS fallback failures are reported as successful harvests",
        "trigger": "Configure two Reddit subreddits; one listing fetch succeeds, another is blocked, and the combined RSS fallback for the blocked subreddit(s) raises SourceUnavailable with no usable cache."
